tory_15236490":{"skip":{"source_cn":"清除赤蚁后，阿邦德感叹神堕贻害无穷，他感谢你的帮助，并打算传达赤蚁已被清除的消息，以此安抚捕鱼居民。","text_i18n":{"cn":"清除赤蚁后，阿邦德感叹神堕贻害无穷，他感谢你的帮助，并打算传达赤蚁已被清除的消息，以此安抚捕鱼居民。","en":"The red ants are gone. Abundius laments the blight left by the fallen god, but thanks you for your help. He'll spread word that the ants are gone to calm the fishermen's fears.","jp":"レッドアントを駆除すると、アバルドは尽きることのない神堕の影響を嘆き、あなたの助力に感謝した。そして漁を営む住民たちを安心させるため、レッドアントが一掃されたことを伝えるという。","kr":"붉은 개미를 몰아낸 뒤, 아반드는 타락한 신의 여파가 끊이지 않는다고 한탄했다. 아반드는 나의 도움에 감사하며 주민들을 안심시키기 위해 붉은 개미가 사라졌다는 소식을 전하기로 했다."},"source":"Plot.SkipText","plot_ids":["15236490"],"localization_status":"exact_hash","record_indices":["25650"]}}}},"faction_dailies/graphs/15010528/1.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_15010528:1:1","roots":["end"],"nodes":{"end":{"id":"end","type":"end"}},"text_entries":{},"speaker_entries":{},"stats":{"node_count":1,"text_entry_count":0},"source":"ExplStep objective boundary, not invented dialogue."},"faction_dailies/graphs/15010528/2.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_15010528:1:2","roots":["end"],"nodes":{"end":{"id":"end","type":"end"}},"text_entries":{},"speaker_entries":{},"stats":{"node_count":1,"text_entry_count":0},"source":"ExplStep objective boundary, not invented dialogue."},"faction_dailies/graphs/15010528/3.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_15010528:1:3","roots":["end"],"nodes":{"end":{"id":"end","type":"end"}},"text_entries":{},"speaker_entries":{},"stats":{"node_count":1,"text_entry_count":0},"source":"ExplStep objective boundary, not invented dialogue."},"faction_dailies/graphs/15010528/4.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_15010528:1:4","roots":["end"],"nodes":{"end":{"id":"end","type":"end"}},"text_entries":{},"speaker_entries":{},"stats":{"node_count":1,"text_entry_count":0},"source":"ExplStep objective boundary, not invented dialogue."},"faction_dailies/locales/cn/15010528/1.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"